{"id":28395,"author":"PokerFace","body":"Hello everyone! \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWe have decided to open up referee and streamer applications.\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eApplications will be open from October 3rd through October 13th (10 days from now)\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAnybody is welcome to apply regardless if you will be participating in the next tournament or not.\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003ePlease ensure that your submit your application to the subforum \"Ref/Streamer Applications with one of the formats listed below.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e[STREAMER]\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.0001pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003eIGN:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.0001pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003eDiscord (Name#):\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.0001pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003eTimezone:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.0001pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\